    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Bennetts Auctioneers are delighted to bring No. 8 Lea Crescent to the market. Ideally situated on a quiet residential enclave, just off Lea Road and a short stroll from both Sandymount Village and Strand. The accommodation of c. 105 sq. m. briefly comprises of entrance hall, living room and kitchen/dining room on the ground floor. On the first floor there are three bedrooms and a family bathroom. The attic has been fully converted with a dormer window. Features of the property include gas fired central heating, double glazed windows and a private and secluded garden with rear access.\r\n\r\nExternally to the front, a fair sized garden laid out in lawn bordered by mature shrubbery. To the rear, a private a secluded south facing 100ft garden laid out in lawn with the added benefit of garage and rear access via Lea Road.\r\n\r\nViewing highly recommended.\r\n\r\nLocation\r\n\r\nNo. 8 Lea Crescent enjoys a superb location in the heart of Sandymount, within easy walking distance of Sandymount Village and the picturesque Sandymount Strand. The village offers an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, bars, boutiques and everyday amenities, while the nearby strand and promenade provide an attractive coastal setting for walking and recreation. Ideally positioned within easy reach of a number of highly regarded primary and secondary schools, including Star of the Sea BNS, Scoil Mhuire, St. Michael's College, St Andrew's College and Blackrock College. UCD and Trinity College Dublin are also readily accessible. There are excellent transport links close by, with numerous bus routes and both Sandymount and Sydney Parade DART stations within easy reach. The East Link Bridge and Dublin Port Tunnel are also conveniently accessible by car, providing straightforward access to Dublin city centre, Dublin Airport and surrounding areas."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground floor\r\n\r\nPorch:  0.80m x 1.90m  tiled flooring\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall:  4.45m x 2.00m  carpet flooring, dado rail, under stair storage  \r\n\r\nLiving room:  4.00m x 3.65m  carpet flooring, large bay window, fireplace with gas insert, built in cabinetry   \r\n\r\nSitting room:  3.70m x 2.95m  carpet flooring, coving, original fireplace with electric insert\r\n\r\nDining room:  2.20m x 2.95m  carpet flooring, large picture window to rear garden\r\n\r\nKitchen:  5.00m x 2.60m  lino flooring, range of floor and eye level units, tiled splashback, integrated appliances, stainless steel sink, window and door to rear garden   \r\n\r\nFirst floor\r\n\r\nLanding:  carpet flooring   \r\n\r\nBedroom 1:  3.95m x 3.25m  carpet flooring, large bay window to front, built in wardrobes    \r\n\r\nBedroom 2:  3.70m x 3.25m  carpet flooring, custom built in wardrobes, window to rear garden \r\n\r\nBedroom 3:  2.65m x 2.30m  carpet flooring, picture rail, built in wardrobes, window to front \r\n \r\nBathroom:  2.60m x 2.30m  fully tiled, walk in shower, heated towel rail, dual windows to rear garden, W.H.B., W.C., hot press\r\n\r\nAttic:  3.40m x 3.75m  carpet flooring, built in wardrobe, W.H.B, dormer window to rear\r\n\r\n\r\nExterior\r\n\r\nExternally to the front, a fair sized garden laid out in lawn bordered by mature shrubbery. To the rear, a private and secluded south-facing garden measuring approximately 100 ft., which is laid out in lawn with a raised patio area and large brick garage which further benefits from rear access via Lea Road.\r\n\r\nTotal Floor area: c.  105 sq. m."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Charming three bedroom mid terrace family home\r\n\r\nIdeal location adjacent to Sandymount Strand and minutes from Sandymount Village\r\n\r\nPrivate and secluded 100 ft south facing rear garden \r\n\r\nGFCH and Aluminium double glazed windows throughout\r\n\r\nFully converted attic with dormer window\r\n\r\nRear pedestrian and vehicular access \r\n\r\nTotal floor area c.105 sq. m."
      },
